 | Assign role | Admin, owner | Users are **separated by role**; employees receive granular permissions, not admin/owner role. |
 
+## Staff Access (authentication)
+
+Session-based login for staff accounts (Livewire, pt-BR by default).
+
+- **Login and register are guest-only.** An authenticated user visiting them is sent to `home`.
+- **Home needs a verified e-mail.** Unverified accounts are sent to the verification notice; the verification link only verifies the logged-in user, and the resend is throttled (6/min).
+- **Failed logins** are limited to 5 per lowercase e-mail + IP pair; the lock message is shown on the e-mail field.
+- **Registration** is limited to 5 submissions per IP; new accounts start unverified.
+- **Password policy** (one app-wide rule, `Password::defaults()`): at least 8 characters, letters in both cases, and numbers. Registration and password reset both use it.
+- **Forgot password** always answers with the same message, so it never reveals whether an e-mail is registered; requests are throttled to 6/min. A reset rotates `remember_token`.
+
 ## Queue and Tickets
 
 ### Ticket
